            "\\section{Results of Comparison via Rating}\n",
            "\\label{app:rating}\n",
            "\n",
            "By default, we obtain the LLM \\evaluators{}' preference by presenting two outputs simultaneously and requesting a comparative judgment.\n",
            "Alternatively, a less prevalent rating approach asks the LLM to assign a rating score to each output independently and subsequently compare the scores of the two outputs~\\citep{bansal2023peering}.\n",
